  "design": {
    "idea": "Mount a tame Sap-Horn beetle to cross the wide amber sap river, bank a Prism bolt off its mirrored carapace into the NW blue eye to raise Lost Moth #8's bridge, then cross east to lure a wild beetle onto the gate plate with your hung lantern and halt it with Sap-Horn.",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ten",
    "teaches": "Riding beetle_mount across sap, using its mirrored carapace as a mobile Prism reflector, and luring + Sap-Horn halting wild beetles onto weight plates.",
    "decisions": 10,
    "expert_s": 56,
    "reward": "moth_3_08+r8_access",
    "why": "Signature Sap-Horn puzzle showcasing all three beetle_mount mechanics (ferry, Prism carapace, wild-lure halt) plus Moth #8.",
    "exit": "exit_r7_east",
